Description: Querencia Desktop software manager (alpha)
 Querencia Software is the software manager of Querencia Desktop, a
 classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2, in the manner of "Add/Remove
 Applications": programs by category from the AppStream catalogue,
 search, a details page, install and remove with progress, the list of
 installed programs and pending updates, with a classic menu bar.
 .
 Package operations run through PackageKit. Installing and removing
 needs a polkit authentication agent in the session; Querencia's own
 agent comes with querencia-sitzung, any other agent works as well.
 Without apt-config-icons the catalogue has icons only for programs
 whose icon is in an installed icon theme.
 .
 The first version handles Debian packages from the configured APT
 sources; Snap, Flatpak and firmware are not shown.
 The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
